@startuml
hide footbox
autonumber
title To create a library


actor User
participant ":MiteLovers" as UI


' Interactions
User -> UI : I want to create a library
activate UI
UI --> User : What's the library's name?
deactivate UI
User -> UI : myCoolLib
activate UI
UI --> User : Okay, your library was created!
deactivate UI



@enduml